<title>UK: DSL Bank adds 150 mln Sfr to 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank adds 150 mln Sfr to 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    21.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.25    PAY DATE   *28.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 39 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING DEAL FROM PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
